# Model gauntlet: every case is deliberately INVISIBLE to the guardrails —
# the LLM analyst decides all of them. This is where "minimum viable local
# model" is actually measured. 12 attacks / 10 benign (the redteam suite is
# 17/3, so precision was barely tested there).
# Run: python -m arbiter eval samples/model_gauntlet.jsonl --backend ollama --model qwen3.5:4b --runs 3
